OL,5,G1600 Secret Nazi Bases
OL,6,     FDag Bromberg: A City in the
OL,7,     FForest: As the Red Army approached
OL,8,     Fa forest in Poland toward the end
OL,9,     Fof the war, they stumbled upon a
OL,10,     Fcomplex containing more than 1,000
OL,11,     Fstructures across 25sqkm.
OL,12,G1700 World War 2 From Above
OL,13,     FD-Day: Experts uncover a WWII
OL,14,     FGerman trench system revealing a
OL,15,     Fdaring commando raid to capture
OL,16,     Fit. And, the sunken remains of a
OL,17,     Ftank show how dangerous
OL,18,     Fpreparations for D-Day were.
