OL,5,G2000 1066: A Year to Conquer England
OL,6,     FNew. After months trapped in a
OL,7,     Fport in France, the winds change
OL,8,     Fand Duke William leads his
OL,9,     Finvasion fleet across the Channel
OL,10,     F- but King Harold is 300 miles
OL,11,     Faway, having defeated the Vikings.
OL,12,G2100 Empire with Michael Portillo
OL,13,     FNew. Jamaica: Michael visits
OL,14,     FJamaica, the Caribbean capital of
OL,15,     Fthe Empire, heading to Fort
OL,16,     FCharles where the Empire enlisted
OL,17,     Fthe help of pirates to defend the
OL,18,     Fnew territory from the Spanish.
